{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"As you struggle, gasp, and scream, you see a familiar form approaching. Sonora dismounts from Flip and approaches you under the waves. You are properly under the water now, and she taps your forehead. Suddenly, you can breathe again, as a small bubble of air surrounds your head. You are still sinking, however. She looks to you and speaks. \"I have saved you, Cairn. What will you offer me in return?\" She seems mostly curious.","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:05:37.187000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864673961081700383","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"Criiist!\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:05:54.911000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864674035420626945","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
