{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"She chuckles. \"you made quite the show of it. There are easier ways to get a gal's attention, you know\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:07:07.182000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864674338547171329","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"I just-\" he hacks \"ack, I just wanted to see you again.\"  he smiles, \"it's been a rough day\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:08:07.217000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864674590353784909","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"Well unless you decided you *want* to give something away, you picked possibly the worst way to do it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:08:45.467000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864674750785519666","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"He smirks, \" of course I do.\" \"I do..yeah.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:10:26.781000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864675175726841856","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"Oh?\" she asks, her mouth forming into a small grin","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:10:48.621000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864675267330965536","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"He pulls up his rucksack and pulls out a Very Rare Zephyrous Essence.\n\"I brought you a present.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:11:46.478000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864675510000025660","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"A little bit of my world, you can bring into yours.\" He smiles","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:12:19.745000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-14T01:12:23.397000Z","id":"864675649532592168","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"She chuckles. \"That's very thoughtful of you, but to tell the truth there isn't much use i have for something like that. I'd much rather have a part of you directly. I don't need a surface dweller's air, but you do have other things of note that interest me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:14:18.676000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864676148364967946","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"What could I possibly offer you but my compassion?\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:15:16.695000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864676391714160730","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"I'd give you my left hand but then I couldn't play... hehe.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:16:32.686000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864676710442991636","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"She shakes her head. \"Nothing so simple. You're familiar with how the fey can take names, yes? I want something like that.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:17:25.049000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864676930069200936","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"His smile goes flat.","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:17:57.524000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864677066279485440","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"But surely...\" he looks around him at the dark waters swirling ready to claim his life.","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:18:59.252000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864677325185613876","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"he gulps","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:20:25.472000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864677686819160064","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"We're friends, so it needn't be a-something as dramatic or important as a name. But to a fey, small pieces of identity and life and the sweetest currency available. Were I anyone else i would likely think that captured air essence delightful. But because of who i am, it has little value to me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:20:57.923000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864677822928781344","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
