{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"Will it be gone forever?\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:25:54.831000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864679068251586571","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"She looks down at the compass Cairn holds in his hand. \"This I would gladly take. But I could equally take a childhood memory, or your memory of where home was, or an experience of comfort.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:29:07.567000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864679876643782656","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"It would no longer be yours. But it is not as if it would dissapear. It would simply be mine to appreciate and hold instead of yours.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:29:39.591000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864680010962042880","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"Cairn looks down at the compass. \"Take a memory?\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:40:09.631000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864682653542514719","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"She nods. \"Not just any memory, but yes.\"","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:40:52.991000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864682835406749716","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"He thinks for a moment.","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:40:56.350000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864682849495547954","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"TAO","id":"267178019196633099","is_bot":0,"username":"dm_tao"},"author_id":"267178019196633099","channel_id":"852738741537865769","content":"\"I could not lose the memory of my sister at the price of my own life. For I'd rather die than forget her. Please take her.. Iona's Compass. \"","created_at":"2021-07-14T01:42:57.191000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864683356339437629","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
